From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Martin=20Storsj=C3=B6?= <martin@martin.st>
Date: Fri, 28 Aug 2026 11:31:10 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] crt: Enable silencing of -Wattribute-alias warnings on
 Clang 23 too
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Clang 23 added the -Wattribute-alias warning just like GCC has had
since GCC 8.

Signed-off-by: Martin Storsjö <martin@martin.st>
(cherry picked from commit 01290efca885ae171f427ddbd338d21ac265a658)
---
 mingw-w64-crt/include/internal.h | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/mingw-w64-crt/include/internal.h b/mingw-w64-crt/include/internal.h
index 004776c6..def6cf64 100644
--- a/mingw-w64-crt/include/internal.h
+++ b/mingw-w64-crt/include/internal.h
@@ -308,7 +308,8 @@ static inline unsigned int __mingw_statusfp(void)
 
 #endif
 
-#if defined(__GNUC__) && __GNUC__ >= 8
+#if (defined(__GNUC__) && __GNUC__ >= 8) || \
+    (defined(__clang_major__) && __clang_major__ >= 23)
 #define PRAGMA_DIAGNOSTIC_IGNORED_ATTRIBUTE_ALIAS_BEGIN     \
     _Pragma("GCC diagnostic push")                          \
     _Pragma("GCC diagnostic ignored \"-Wattribute-alias\"")
